WEBVTT

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:38.610
Let's spread our wings and flutter away,
and awaken from the dream of a thousand years.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:44.830
Time is a kaleidoscope, and
its afterimages are jewels.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:52.240
Even if a mischievous cloud gets in our way,
we're not alone. We won't give up.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:02:01.350
Fly toward the sky of hope.
The butterfly floats through my dreams.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.840
Wow, Miu-sama! You're great!

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.740
I am, aren't I?

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:08.730
Tell me more about how wonderful I am.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:12.270
After all that singing, I'm thirsty.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.690
Choukun, bring me some honey water.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.930
Right away.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.330
Oh, and there were those honeyed
peaches I received as a gift.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:23.300
Bring those, too!

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.450
You can have one or the other, Miu-sama.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.350
Why?

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.650
I want both!

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.480
You just ate a snack.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:35.920
If you get a stomachache like
last time, don't blame me.

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.100
I don't want a stomachache...

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:46.310
Of course you don't. So pick either the
honey water or the honeyed peaches.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.150
It's a difficult choice...

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.910
After singing, drinking honey water
always tastes so wonderful!

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:05.680
And your smile after drinking the
honey water is wonderful, too, Miu-sama!

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:11.620
Come to think of it, I heard someone from
Toutaku's place is arriving today.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:18.550
Yes. It's about that time...
I wonder what happened.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:23.550
<b>Episode 7
Chinkyuu is taken in
by Ryofu</b>

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:31.370
This is the city that Enjutsu-dono rules?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.980
We're finally here.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:39.690
Strange... The city where a lord lives
is usually more lively than this.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.560
That's true...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:46.080
Enjutsu-san is related to Enshou-san,

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.920
so maybe she's not really
cut out to be a rule-

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.780
<i>Giant balls!</i>

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.960
H-Hey, Rin Rin! Don't say
stuff like that so loudly!

00:03:58.220 --> 00:03:59.690
That's right, Rin Rin.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:02.340
There are more euphemistic ways to put it.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.020
Maybe "testicles" or "gonads."

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.850
I don't think either of those
are euphemisms.

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.930
A gift shop.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:16.630
That's right. When we were leaving,
Riri asked for a present.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.900
Let's take a look.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.250
Look at all the cups.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:36.580
This one's kind of cute!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.500
Yeah, but how about a bigger
one that she'd use more?

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.930
Shuri, here's a cup for you.

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.980
If you pour hot water into it, you
can see through the clothes.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.960
Sei-san...

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.620
Or how about this kodakara candy?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.270
Why do you keep suggesting stuff like that?

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.040
They've got all kinds of animals!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.360
These are protective charms, aren't they?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.650
Um, let me see...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.190
The mouse brings lots of children to you
and prosperity to your descendants.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:08.880
The dog barks to scare off
demons that cause illness.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.770
The cat brings in good luck to
make your business prosper.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.330
The different types have
different effects, huh?

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:21.530
Then I'm getting the one for keeping away illness,
so I won't get sick to my stomach like last time!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:26.250
Actually, I think you'd do better by covering
your stomach while you sleep.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.570
Nene found this first!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:35.790
What are you doing?

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.460
That's mine!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:40.530
You haven't paid yet, so it is not!

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:42.230
You're nuts!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.690
No fighting!

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:47.720
What's wrong?

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.000
Did Rin Rin do something again?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:55.620
No. For once, Rin Rin-chan's
actually in the right here.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:01.360
Yeah, Rin Rin is correct here.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.550
Hell must have frozen over.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.940
I-I know!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.890
Why don't you ask the shopkeeper?

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.830
They might have a second one.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.640
I'm sorry. The one out front
is the only one I have.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:23.290
I don't know when I'll get more in.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.320
Sorry, but you'll have to give up.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.450
Well, don't worry about it.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.780
You only get one shot at everything.
Sometimes you win, and sometimes you lose.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:37.020
Sei-san, that doesn't help at all.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.280
Why, you...

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:39.740
Why, you...

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.520
Why, you...

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.130
<i>I hope a raccoon washes out your
bellybutton and you catch a cold!</i>

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.010
Wh-What the heck was that?

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.750
Thank you!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.150
That was good!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:00.980
Yeah?

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.480
I didn't think it was that good.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.120
Rin Rin-chan!

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:08.800
Don't forget the little dog you just bought.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.210
Oh, right.

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:12.440
Hey, be careful, Rin Rin.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.880
What did you buy at that
gift shop, Koumei-chan?

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:21.540
I bought that big mug.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.750
It's not very cute,

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.710
but I thought it might be good
for drinking herb water.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.800
That's...

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.510
Oh! Hey, Ryofu!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.720
Kan'u, Chouhi, Chou'un.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:42.930
A big doggie!

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:49.110
<i>Chinkyuu knee drop!</i>

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:59.080
Ren-dono, I've told you so many times
not to wander off on your own!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:03.000
And you're letting people you've
never met get right next to you.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:06.320
Even if we're at peace, this
is foreign territory.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.510
You need to be careful-

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:09.280
What the heck was that for?

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.680
Sh-Shut up! I'm busy...

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.260
You're the one...

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.100
Chinkyuu.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.970
You didn't do the knee drop right.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.900
That's not the problem here!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:42.080
Anyway, you serve Toutaku-dono.
What are you doing here?

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:44.090
I came for an arranged marriage.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.340
An arranged marriage? You?

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.130
No.

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.260
Then...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.530
No.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.180
Chinkyuu is still too young for intercourse.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.890
I-Intercourse...

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.810
Shuri, what's intercourse?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.930
Y-You don't need to know!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.770
It's still too early for you!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.940
Yeah.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.850
It's still too early for Rin Rin.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:12.030
But don't you think it's about
time for you, Aisha?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.240
None of your business!

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:18.580
Then who's getting married?

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.620
He is.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.800
The dog?

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:26.260
His name is Chouchou. He's big.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:30.540
Unless he has someone as big as himself,
intercourse will be difficult.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.670
I, uh, see...

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:38.970
We'd heard Enjutsu has the same kind of dog,
so we came to arrange a marriage.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.640
But we're giving up.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.460
The discussions didn't go well?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.810
We haven't been to Enjutsu's place yet.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:51.360
The people here are unhappy.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.780
It's probably the lords fault.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:58.200
Arranging a marriage with such a person
would not be to Chouchou's benefit.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:01.630
So we're going home without doing it.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.440
Way to go, Ren-dono!

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:06.070
I was thinking the same thing.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:09.210
You're acting awfully haughty.
Who are you, anyway?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.920
I am Chinkyuu,

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.090
Ren-dono's strategist!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:16.840
Strategist?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:22.550
As her strategist, I serve Ren-dono, the
land's strongest warrior, with my life!

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:25.440
With your life...

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.020
Why go that far?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.770
It's a long story...

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:41.860
I was an orphan. I survived by transporting
goat's milk, from farms to town,

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:48.370
in a cart pulled by Chouchou,
which I'd had since I was a kid.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.370
But one night, it rained really hard...

00:10:58.560 --> 00:11:03.970
The watermill where I'd been
staying caught fire.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.720
The truth was that they hadn't been
taking care of the watermill,

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:12.730
so the wooden gears,
rubbing together, caught fire.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:19.320
But they blamed me for not being careful,
and they kicked me out of the village.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:26.320
After that, I wandered from village
to village with Chouchou.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:30.960
Helping traveling performers
with their puppets,

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.780
sweeping chimneys...

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:54.480
In order to survive, I did many
jobs along my travels.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.770
And when I reached a certain town...

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:02.070
Please! I'll do anything if you give me a job.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.470
I'll work my hardest!

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.260
I haven't eaten in ten days-

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.410
Shut up! {D: TC - missing line}

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:11.370
It's been hard for everyone.
There's no work for us!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.720
Like hell I'd give a job to some kid who
wandered in from who-knows-where.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:18.090
If you're going to beg, beg
in your own village!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:25.420
I'm not begging... I'm not begging.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:30.750
I just want to work in order to eat.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:36.730
So I'm not... I'm not a beggar.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.580
Don't worry.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.200
It takes more than that to get me down.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:54.210
But...

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.880
That doesn't fill my stomach.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.110
What's wrong, Chouchou?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:07.300
Did you find something to eat?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:17.150
I'm jealous. You can eat anything.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.360
We'll sleep there tonight.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:26.280
Even if there's no food, it'll
keep the rain and dew off.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:42.590
Chouchou... I'm tired.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.170
This is... This smell...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.450
Want one?

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:59.190
N-No!

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.130
I'm not a beggar!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:09.920
When I'm hungry, I want food.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.550
When I eat, I feel happy.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:20.000
It's much happier to feel happy with others,
instead of feeling happy alone.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:26.480
So if you're hungry, have dinner with me.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.770
Are you full?

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.130
Yeah.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:49.200
I see.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.760
It will be dark soon.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.750
You should go home.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:01.170
You don't have a place to go?

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.320
Then come with me.

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.150
Come home with me.

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.550
What, Ryofu?

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:20.700
You picked up another pair of lost animals?

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:27.260
Both of them are pretty dirty.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.450
But they're cute.

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:33.520
If you say so, then I guess they are.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.510
You can keep them, but
be sure to wash them.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:39.000
If they're unclean, Kaku'll get upset.

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:51.330
You brought home more filthy animals!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.360
How many is that this month?

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.670
One... Two... Three...

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:58.000
Many.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.830
You don't need to count!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:07.680
The place is filled with them, so one or
two more won't make any difference.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.740
You can keep them if you want, but
be sure to train them properly.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:15.320
If there's peeing in my bed
again, I'll be upset.

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.450
Understood.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:19.320
I won't let them pee in your bed.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.730
Wait!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:28.190
I'm fine with the big dog, but if I look closely,
the shorty's actually a human!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.150
What are you talking about?!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.270
Dirty but cute.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.480
Dirty but cute.

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.010
The same.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:40.440
Of course they aren't!

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:41.540
What's her name?

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.110
How old is she?

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:44.140
Where did you get her?

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:49.080
You didn't just walk off with
someone's kid 'cause you liked it, did you?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:50.420
Well?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.840
Kaku, it's not good to get mad.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.260
She's scared.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.020
We can talk about this later.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:01.720
For now, wash those filthy things!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.330
Kaku will be mad if you're grimy.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.230
So I'm cleaning you up.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.920
Wait...

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:24.970
No. If you do that, it tickles.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.840
I can do it myself...

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.870
I said...

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:51.660
I haven't slept in a bed for so long,
it's actually hard to sleep.

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:52.730
Chinkyuu.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.130
Wh-When did you come in?

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.050
You can't sleep?

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.950
Yes.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.900
Then...

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:13.140
Some of the animals I bring home have trouble getting
used to it here and can't sleep right away.

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:17.050
When that happens, I always do this.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.500
She smells good...

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:34.320
I can't remember of what, but
it brings back memories.

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:39.150
Everyone I bring here is my child.

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.030
So you are, too.

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:45.530
So relax and sleep.

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:53.010
At that moment, I swore to myself...

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:59.550
That I would follow Ren-dono forever.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.710
That I would stay with her forever.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.760
And so, I wanted to be as
useful to her as I could.

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:07.720
I see. That's what happened.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.740
Chinkyuu-san, it must have been so hard!

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:15.690
She couldn't sleep by herself?

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.190
What a spoiled brat!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.860
I'm not a spoiled brat!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.160
No! Your being happy she slept in the same
bed is proof you're a spoiled brat!

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:27.350
So happiness when someone sleeps with
you is proof you're a spoiled brat, huh?

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.240
Wh-What? What are you getting at?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.620
No, nothing.

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:37.740
We need to get moving!

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:40.690
Let's find an inn and get dinner!

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.230
That's true. Let's get going.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.140
Yeah.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:46.140
Chinkyuu, we're leaving, too.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:47.220
Roger!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.520
Shopkeeper, we're leaving the money here.

00:20:56.280 --> 00:21:02.690
Ryofu, you had a little wooden dog
on the end of your Houtenkageki.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.060
What happened to it?

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.990
In the last war we fought, she got into a scrape with
the enemy. Before we knew it, it was gone.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:11.950
I see. You lost it on the battlefield.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.290
I really liked it,

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.760
so I'm very sad.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.650
Then...

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.760
Goodbye!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.900
Yeah. May we meet again.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:37.770
Wait!

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:43.490
I'm giving you this.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.990
But this is...

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.460
I changed my mind. I don't
want it anymore.

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:55.960
So I'm giving it to you.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.680
Thank you!

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:01.310
What?

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:02.460
It's a secret.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:04.420
Stingy...

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:07.770
Just wait till we get back to the inn.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:09.350
You'll be so surprised!

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:13.700
Ren-dono, come on.

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:15.890
We're going back now!

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:18.640
Ren-dono!

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:23.500
Chouhi-chan, you're so nice.

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:27.820
That's right. Rin Rin-chan is so nice!

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.260
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:34.240
I'm selfish, and I eat too much,
and I pick too many fights.

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.650
But I'm not, <i>absolutely not </i>kind!

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:40.010
That's right, Rin Rin.

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:44.550
You're selfish, and you eat too much,
and you pick too many fights.

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.610
That's not true!

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:48.670
I've got good points, too!

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:50.520
Which is it?

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:28.240
Chinkyuu-san!

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:30.480
Yes?

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:33.930
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime
Musou,</i> Episode 8:

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:37.660
Enjutsu Orders a Monster's Extermination.

00:24:37.660 --> 00:24:42.080
Chinkyuu, get the viewers to
marry this anime character.

00:24:44.280 --> 00:24:50.000
Very well, Enjutsu-sama. But first,
get them off the TV screen.

00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:51.880
Impudent girl!

00:24:50.010 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Episode 8
Enjutsu Orders a
Monster's Extermination</b>

00:24:51.880 --> 00:24:53.370
Off with her head!

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:59.960
<b>Watch us again, OK?
And rewatch this episode!</b>
